cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Quant-Pulse-Processor"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light quantum computing toolkit in pure Python and NumPy:
  statevector simulation, canonical algorithms (QFT, Grover, Deutsch-Jozsa,
  QAOA, VQE), and pulse-level transmon control with Lindblad noise and DRAG
  leakage suppression.
type: software
authors:
